==English==

===Etymology===
From the fact that the species is a ''[[dove]]'' with a black ''[[collar]]'' around its neck.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[collared]] [[dove]]}}

# A [[bird]] of the species ''[[Streptopelia decaocto]]'', also known as the "European '''collared dove'''".

